## Workout C
main / 1x5 40%, 1x5 55%, 1x5 65%, 1x5 75%, 1x3 85%, 1x8 65%
Squat / ...main[3]
Bench Press / ...main[3]
Bent Over Row / ...main[3]
Hammer Curl / 3x8-12 / progress: lp(5lb)

